@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080

### Expected: 200, process liveness only
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 503 until storage and security are implemented
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Expected: foundation metadata, all configured flags false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/info
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 404; account management is not exposed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
